<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="description" content="Claude Developer Project — an open-source project exploring practical AI-assisted development workflows." />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#11100e" />
  <title>Claude Developer Project | Open Source</title>

  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#fbfaf7;
      --ink:#171513;
      --muted:#6f6a63;
      --card:#ffffff;
      --line:#e8e2da;
      --accent:#d97745;
      --accent-dark:#b85d30;
      --dark:#171513;
      --dark-2:#25211d;
      --green:#2f7d5a;
      --shadow:0 18px 55px rgba(23,21,19,.10);
      --radius:24px;
    }

    *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
    html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
    body{
      font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;
      color:var(--ink);
      background:var(--bg);
      line-height:1.6;
    }
    a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}
    .container{width:min(1120px,92%);margin:auto}

    nav{
      position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;
      background:rgba(251,250,247,.88);
      backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
      border-bottom:1px solid rgba(232,226,218,.8);
    }
    .nav-inner{
      height:72px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
    }
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-weight:800;font-size:20px}
    .logo{
      width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:12px;
      display:grid;place-items:center;color:white;font-weight:900;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#e9a16e);
      box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(217,119,69,.25);
    }
    .links{display:flex;gap:25px;color:#514c46;font-size:14px}
    .links a:hover{color:var(--accent)}
    .nav-btn{
      background:var(--dark);color:#fff;padding:10px 17px;border-radius:12px;
      font-size:14px;font-weight:700;
    }

    .hero{padding:100px 0 85px;overflow:hidden;position:relative}
    .hero:before{
      content:"";position:absolute;width:500px;height:500px;border-radius:50%;
      right:-220px;top:-180px;background:rgba(217,119,69,.09);filter:blur(10px);
    }
    .eyebrow{
      display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:7px 12px;
      border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;background:#fff;
      color:#5f5952;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:22px;
    }
    .dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green)}
    h1{
      max-width:850px;font-size:clamp(44px,7vw,78px);
      line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-3px;margin-bottom:24px;
    }
    .hero p{
      max-width:690px;color:var(--muted);font-size:20px;line-height:1.7;
    }
    .actions{display:flex;gap:13px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:34px}
    .btn{
      display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;
      padding:14px 20px;border-radius:14px;font-weight:800;
      border:1px solid var(--line);transition:.2s;
    }
    .btn-primary{background:var(--dark);color:#fff;border-color:var(--dark)}
    .btn-primary:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);background:#2a2622}
    .btn-secondary{background:#fff}
    .btn-secondary:hover{border-color:#cfc6bb;transform:translateY(-2px)}

    .trust{
      display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;margin-top:65px;
    }
    .mini{
      background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:22px;
    }
    .mini strong{display:block;font-size:25px;margin-bottom:3px}
    .mini span{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}

    section{padding:85px 0}
    .section-head{max-width:700px;margin-bottom:38px}
    .section-head h2{font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,48px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-1.5px;margin-bottom:14px}
    .section-head p{color:var(--muted);font-size:17px}

    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}
    .card{
      background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);
      padding:30px;box-shadow:0 7px 25px rgba(23,21,19,.04);
    }
    .icon{
      width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:15px;background:#fff3eb;
      display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:23px;margin-bottom:20px;
    }
    .card h3{font-size:21px;margin-bottom:9px}
    .card p{color:var(--muted);font-size:15px}

    .dark-section{
      background:var(--dark);color:#fff;border-radius:34px;
      margin:20px auto;width:min(1120px,92%);
    }
    .dark-section .section-head p{color:#bdb6ae}
    .dark-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:22px}
    .use-box{
      border:1px solid #39332e;background:var(--dark-2);border-radius:22px;padding:28px;
    }
    .use-box h3{margin-bottom:12px;font-size:20px}
    .use-box ul{padding-left:20px;color:#c7c0b8}
    .use-box li{margin:8px 0}

    .cta{
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff1e8,#fffaf6);
      border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:30px;padding:50px;
      display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:30px;
    }
    .cta h2{font-size:38px;line-height:1.1;margin-bottom:10px}
    .cta p{color:var(--muted);max-width:650px}

    footer{
      border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:35px 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;
    }
    .footer-inner{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .small-links{display:flex;gap:18px}
    .small-links a:hover{color:var(--accent)}

    @media(max-width:800px){
      .links{display:none}
      .hero{padding:70px 0 60px}
      h1{letter-spacing:-2px}
      .hero p{font-size:17px}
      .trust,.grid,.dark-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      section{padding:65px 0}
      .cta{padding:32px;display:block}
      .cta .actions{margin-top:25px}
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <nav>
    <div class="container nav-inner">
      <a class="brand" href="#top">
        <span class="logo">C</span>
        <span>Claude Project</span>
      </a>

      <div class="links">
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#features">Features</a>
        <a href="#use">Development</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
      </div>

      <a class="nav-btn" href="https://github.com/sidtech366/Claude" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        GitHub ↗
      </a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <main id="top">

    <header class="hero">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> Open-source developer project</div>

        <h1>Building practical AI-powered software, one feature at a time.</h1>

        <p>
          Claude Project is an independent open-source development project focused on
          experimenting with practical AI-assisted workflows, software development,
          automation, and useful tools for real-world applications.
        </p>

        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://github.com/sidtech366/Claude" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            View on GitHub →
          </a>
          <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#about">
            Explore Project
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="trust">
          <div class="mini">
            <strong>Open Source</strong>
            <span>Public development on GitHub</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mini">
            <strong>AI-Assisted</strong>
            <span>Designed around modern AI workflows</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mini">
            <strong>Developer Focus</strong>
            <span>Built to accelerate practical software work</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section id="about">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2>About the project</h2>
          <p>
            The project is being developed as an open-source space for building,
            testing, and improving AI-assisted developer experiences.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid">
          <article class="card">
            <div class="icon">⚡</div>
            <h3>Faster Development</h3>
            <p>
              Explore AI-assisted coding, debugging, planning, documentation,
              and feature development to reduce repetitive development work.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <div class="icon">🧩</div>
            <h3>Practical Tools</h3>
            <p>
              Focus on useful software capabilities that can be applied to
              real projects rather than only experimental demonstrations.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <div class="icon">🌍</div>
            <h3>Open Development</h3>
            <p>
              The project is publicly hosted on GitHub so development,
              improvements, and future contributions can happen transparently.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="dark-section" id="use">
      <section>
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-head">
            <h2>How AI can accelerate the project</h2>
            <p>
              AI assistance can be used throughout the software-development
              lifecycle while keeping the project source and decisions under developer control.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="dark-grid">
            <div class="use-box">
              <h3>Development workflow</h3>
              <ul>
                <li>Architecture and implementation planning</li>
                <li>Code generation and refactoring</li>
                <li>Bug investigation and debugging</li>
                <li>Testing and quality improvements</li>
                <li>Technical documentation</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="use-box">
              <h3>Future direction</h3>
              <ul>
                <li>More developer automation</li>
                <li>Improved AI-assisted workflows</li>
                <li>Better project documentation</li>
                <li>Community-driven improvements</li>
                <li>Real-world AI integrations</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <section id="features">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2>Built with an open-source mindset.</h2>
          <p>
            The project is intended to grow through continuous development,
            experimentation, documentation, and feedback.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid">
          <article class="card">
            <div class="icon">💻</div>
            <h3>Developer Friendly</h3>
            <p>Simple web-first presentation with a lightweight structure suitable for GitHub Pages.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <div class="icon">🔬</div>
            <h3>Experiment & Improve</h3>
            <p>New ideas can be tested quickly and refined based on practical results and feedback.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <div class="icon">🔓</div>
            <h3>Transparent</h3>
            <p>Public source code makes it possible for others to inspect, learn from, and contribute to the work.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="cta">
          <div>
            <h2>Follow the project on GitHub.</h2>
            <p>
              See the source code, development history, issues, and future improvements
              in the public repository.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="actions">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://github.com/sidtech366/Claude" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              Open Repository ↗
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="container footer-inner">
      <div>© 2026 Claude Project · Open-source developer project</div>
      <div class="small-links">
        <a href="https://github.com/sidtech366/Claude" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
        <a href="#top">Back to top ↑</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
